n### 👹 Monster ESP\nDetects and highlights dangerous moving entities with red highlight and floating name labels.\n\n### 📍 All Objects ESP\nDisplays every detectable object around the map with full path/name display.\n\n### 📦 Item ESP\nTracks collectible and interactable items with orange indicators and optional tracers.\n\n### ⚠️ Anomaly ESP\nMonitors tracked objects and detects abnormal changes (position, size, color, material, transparency, physics, textures, brightness, parent changes, creation, disappearance, child count).\n\n### ⚡ Speed (25)\nIncreases movement speed.\n\n### 🕊 Fly (PC Only)\nFree flight movement with full directional control.\n\n### 🚪 Noclip\nWalk through objects and collisions.\n\n### ☀️ Fullbright\nRemoves darkness and improves visibility.\n\n### 🔭 FOV (100)\nExpanded field of view.\n\n### 👒 Chinese Hat\nCosmetic neon hat visual with glass styling.\n\n### 💗 Pink Trail\nCreates a moving trail effect behind the player.\n\nModern UI with multiple tabs, toggle system, minimize mode, and mobile support.","tags":["AnomalyWatch","Horror","FREEEE","HVH"],"discord":"","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6a3be5b4e41b28e695e413f9","username":"sqworexo","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b87a6ef676827a8337f45cbdf9e8e6cee40d0c836b9a7f745d68078611b61692.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a3be5b4e41b28e695e413f9-1782310372659.jpg"},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"6a3be5b4e41b28e695e413f9","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b87a6ef676827a8337f45cbdf9e8e6cee40d0c836b9a7f745d68078611b61692.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a3be5b4e41b28e695e413f9-1782310372659.jpg"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-19T21:51:43.750Z","last":"","win":14,"math":3},"isHub":false,"supportedGames":[],"changelog":[{"_id":"6a4728049bb2d9ee38af2739","editBy":{"_id":"6a3be5b4e41b28e695e413f9","username":"sqworexo","status":"offline","id":"6a3be5b4e41b28e695e413f9"},"message":"Create script","createdAt":"2026-07-03T03:09:56.555Z"}],"comments":[{"_id":"6a7b23a44e75675e832af045","commentBy":{"_id":"6a7b22c6e62e7b3b3f39c390","username":"theguyofalltime","verified":false,"role":"user","profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0afab815cd37978c637a893654fcdd2dda50dd89551f502dbdfeba1cda4750cc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a7b22c6e62e7b3b3f39c390-1786454763485.jpeg"},"lastActive":"2026-08-11T13:29:20.987Z","createdAt":"2026-08-11T13:25:26.944Z","status":"offline","id":"6a7b22c6e62e7b3b3f39c390","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0afab815cd37978c637a893654fcdd2dda50dd89551f502dbdfeba1cda4750cc.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a7b22c6e62e7b3b3f39c390-1786454763485.jpeg"}},"text":"great script but anomaly ESP is kinda broken on delta ios\nand auto win doesnt work because it will js give you the “TOO MANY ANOMALIES PRESENT” warning and freeze the clock thus making the game never-ending\nmonster ESP works great tho and auto win is incredible for escaping intruders","edited":false,"likeCount":1,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-08-11T13:29:08.494Z","liked":false,"disliked":false}]}